      "id": "h_sub",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 92,
      "text": "How one recording becomes a workflow, file by file. Record v2 (feat/record-v2, merged 21 Oct 2026; updated 23 Oct 2026 after step 4, PR #15).\nNumbers follow the order things happen. Replay, recovery and repair are left out.",
