    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "p4_rules",
      "x": 1950,
      "y": 940,
      "text": "· a double click is one click\n· a selection + its copy = one read\n· tab switches with nothing done between are dropped\n· a paste takes the copy made just before it\n· a page opened in another tab is its own step\n· noise is removed AND listed (x1, x2… with the reason);\n  the agent can put one back",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "seed": 400016,
      "originalText": "· a double click is one click\n· a selection + its copy = one read\n· tab switches with nothing done between are dropped\n· a paste takes the copy made just before it\n· a page opened in another tab is its own step\n· noise is removed AND listed (x1, x2… with the reason);\n  the agent can put one back",
      "roughness": 0,
