    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "b7b_t",
      "x": 1424,
      "y": 1662,
      "text": "7b BUILD\nan agent with tools, up to 8 calls a turn:\n· accept / reject p1, p2…\n· remove / restore / add / change / move\n· loop (around steps, or new ones) / branch\n· ai_step / trigger / input / look / ask\n· test / done\ncode refuses a step the runner can't run,\nand a call resent as it failed",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "containerId": "b7b",
      "seed": 800023,
      "originalText": "7b BUILD\nan agent with tools, up to 8 calls a turn:\n· accept / reject p1, p2…\n· remove / restore / add / change / move\n· loop (around steps, or new ones) / branch\n· ai_step / trigger / input / look / ask\n· test / done\ncode refuses a step the runner can't run,\nand a call resent as it failed",
