      "id": "b7d_t",
      "x": 2304,
      "y": 1662,
      "text": "7d ASK\nwhat it still can't tell, in one batch:\n· at most 5 questions\n· each next to its step\n· the rest take their default,\n  listed in the review\n· never the time of day: 9:00\n  unless you said one",
