      "id": "wd_b",
      "x": 64,
      "y": 2670,
      "text": "evidence     all that code learned about the\n             recording, in one file (6)\nproposal     a change code prepares; the agent\n             says yes or no (6 → 7b)\ntask model   what the agent thinks the task\n             is: outcome, how often, rules (7a)\nfinish gate  code's checklist before a design\n             is saved (7f)",
